#N canvas 40 40 700 460 12;
#X text 20 20 Cut It -- entry point on the Organelle. mother.pd loads this file by name. Keep it thin: it instantiates u_root and nothing else., f 52;
#X obj 20 120 u_root 17 1;
#X text 20 250 The 17 is the Pd channel the nanoKONTROL's own channel 1 lands on and the 1 is the Launchpad's. They are Pd INPUT SLOTS 2 and 1 here \, per /root/.pdsettings \, and slot n gets channels (n-1)*16+1 upward. Set the Mac's MIDI inputs to the same order -- Launchpad first \, nano second -- and main-dev.pd can pass the same two numbers \, which is the point of doing it that way round. This is the ONE line the two entry points are allowed to disagree about., f 52;
#X text 20 170 The Mac entry point is main-dev.pd \, which adds u_mother-stub. It ships in this folder and the device never loads it., f 52;
